          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-body dark:text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Run your 15% rule numbers, toggle 10%–12% nominal vs 7% realistic returns, and test withdrawals.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">
          <span>Launch Tool</span>
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/blogs/dave-ramsey-retirement-calculator-guide/"
        class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas hover:border-primary transition group dark:bg-surface/60 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary block mb-1">Guide 1: Math Theory</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary group-hover:text-primary transition mb-1 text-sm">
            15% Rule, 8% Withdrawals & Money Guy FOO
